provenance.notes:
Streaming is not in this file. GET with Accept: text/event-stream on a readable path answers 200, Content-Type: text/event-stream; charset=utf-8, Connection: close, and first the event "event: put
data: {"path":"/","data":<value>}

" (also with orderBy/limitToFirst, where the first event carried the whole unfiltered value); on a path the rules deny it answers 401 text/plain "Permission denied" with no stream. HEAD responses carry a body, so the capture reads each response from its own connection.

